{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eagle Legacy: Zero</strong> is a <strong>standalone</strong>, <strong>story-driven</strong>, <strong>third-person adventure</strong> that marks the beginning of the Eagle Legacy saga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in <strong>1616</strong>, when myth and reality bleed into one, you follow a wounded fugitive who stumbles into the dominion of an ancient witch, and becomes trapped in her twisted realm of illusions, trials, and forgotten magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this self-contained chapter, you will explore haunted lakes and ruined villages, uncover early spell scrolls and potion recipes, and face the Witch\u2019s first trials, from cursed beasts to skeletal horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must read the signs, gather herbs, mix with care, and cast spells with precision. But beware, a single wrong incantation could doom you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821370?t=1766160674","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821370?t=1766160674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821370/7154e010c39560e6eca99509d3188da96c06f065/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766160674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821370/7154e010c39560e6eca99509d3188da96c06f065/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766160674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains references to death, blood, and disturbing themes. Certain scenes depict corpses and ritual settings with mild visual violence. Player discretion is advised."},"demos":[{"appid":4060760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eagle Legacy: Zero</strong> is a <strong>standalone</strong>, <strong>story-driven</strong>, <strong>third-person adventure</strong> that marks the beginning of the Eagle Legacy saga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in <strong>1616</strong>, when myth and reality bleed into one, you follow a wounded fugitive who stumbles into the dominion of an ancient witch, and becomes trapped in her twisted realm of illusions, trials, and forgotten magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this self-contained chapter, you will explore haunted lakes and ruined villages, uncover early spell scrolls and potion recipes, and face the Witch\u2019s first trials, from cursed beasts to skeletal horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must read the signs, gather herbs, mix with care, and cast spells with precision. But beware, a single wrong incantation could doom you.</p>","developers":["Dovlet Mammedov"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821370/25b195cc3e66326d1b69ceeea98caff22d189871/header.jpg?t=1766160674","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821370/306859700/c08bc1eec38f3fe8b9653dbe4e80079472a5be09/1755013195/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755531982","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821370/306859700/c08bc1eec38f3fe8b9653dbe4e80079472a5be09/1755013195/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755531982","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.